 <strong>Cardmage Parlor</strong> and the <strong>Backroom Printer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/3316531f618c342253c4a4946a34e5ff.poster.avif?t=1768738076\" width=660 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/3316531f618c342253c4a4946a34e5ff.webm?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/3316531f618c342253c4a4946a34e5ff.mp4?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cardmage Parlor</strong> lets you buy/clone/destroy cards or give them buffs which trigger at different times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/dfd4322e46de54486961d9c70b0c13a6.poster.avif?t=1768738076\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/dfd4322e46de54486961d9c70b0c13a6.webm?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/dfd4322e46de54486961d9c70b0c13a6.mp4?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Backroom Printer</strong> you can merge, duplicate, edit or upgrade your items to build even stronger combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Bosses </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/7a28c01dbbe426257e9a5b0c414e121c.poster.avif?t=1768738076\" width=400 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/7a28c01dbbe426257e9a5b0c414e121c.webm?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/7a28c01dbbe426257e9a5b0c414e121c.mp4?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can discard your stack, swap your items around, skip cards, forcibly sell your items or do all kinds of mischievous things, so plan for them accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/3656b4a5a59e7d360ebd4f52c300ed14.poster.avif?t=1768738076\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/3656b4a5a59e7d360ebd4f52c300ed14.webm?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/extras/3656b4a5a59e7d360ebd4f52c300ed14.mp4?t=1768738076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode after a victory to see how far your build can go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +, up to NG+5. Each NG+ expands your inventory and stack size by 1 and also increases the required points for each round.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lisisoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/a2e48650d002ded435fb36d3fbffc0268e943dc8/header.jpg?t=1768738076","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"mi